# Vite copies everything under public/ into dist/, which would pull all 225 MB
# of video into the Vercel deploy — the exact thing R2 exists to avoid.
#
# Deploying from Git already avoids this, because public/assets is gitignored
# and never reaches the repo. This is the belt to that braces: it also covers
# running `vercel` from this folder, where the local files would otherwise be
# uploaded.
public/assets/

photos/
videos/
songs/
ignore/
